        "### Additional EDA Visualizations\n",
        "Let's deep dive into our EDA requirements:\n",
        "1. Compare average charges for smokers vs non-smokers with a bar plot.\n",
        "2. Plot BMI vs charges, colored by smoking status.\n",
        "3. Build a correlation heatmap of numeric features against charges.\n",
        "4. Explore whether charges increase with age and number of children."
